flowchart LR
  Worker[Worker routes] --> Ledger[OperationsLedger Durable Object]
  HubA[RegionalFeedHub A] --> Ledger
  HubB[RegionalFeedHub B] --> Ledger
  HubC[RegionalFeedHub C] --> Ledger
  Delivery[Delivery and ACK outcomes] --> Ledger
  Ledger --> Store[(Central aggregate event buckets)]
  Viewer[Explicit operator health read] --> Health[GET /api/v1/health]
  Health --> Ledger
  Ledger --> Result[Global application and regional SLI contract]
  Privacy[Schema allowlist and retention job] --> Ledger
  Result --> Evidence[Evidence route and release receipt]
